Add the necessary platform data and ostdl setting to enable support
for mt8189 smi.

Signed-off-by: Congcong Yao <congcong.yao@mediatek.com>
Reviewed-by: AngeloGioacchino Del Regno <angelogioacchino.delregno@collabora.com>
